  "html": "<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Cats and More Cats</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-hook\">hook: full <u>Rory O'More</u> in long waves</h2>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/201\">Melanie Axel-Lute</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: Becket </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>6</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>2</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">pass through to <u>next neighbors</u> ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors allemande right 1½</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>0</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">form long waves - gentlespoons face in, ladles face out</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance &amp;  Rory O'More right</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance &amp;  Rory O'More left</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors balance &amp; swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p><a href=\"http://www.maxellute.net/cats.html\">http://www.maxellute.net/cats.html</a></p>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>This dance is something like Peter Stix&#39;s &quot;#1 Grade A Top Quality Cats #2&quot; with <u>Rory O&#39;More</u> moves added. Hence the name.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared to sketchbook\n          </p>\n"
}
